png/25px-Portrait_Cairos.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Portrait_Cairos.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ca%C3%AFros\" title=\"Caïros\">Caïros</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/The_Guild\" title=\"The Guild\">Guild</a> has caught wind of our activities down by the river. The <a href=\"/wiki/Minsc\" title=\"Minsc\">Stone Lord</a> has personally requested that you see off any visitors.\n</p><p><br>\nI have heard murmurings that your dock-side crew begin to doubt the tales around the Stone Lord's capabilities. Keep our shipment secure, and he will not need to come down in person and make a demonstration.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715055455\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.052 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1662/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25062/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5983/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935586/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   43.375      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   43.375      1 -total\n 49.30%   21.383      7 Template:Icon_text\n 43.51%   18.872     17 Template:Trim\n 21.87%    9.488      2 Template:Uid\n 15.31%    6.641      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.21%    5.729      2 Template:Icon_link\n 12.68%    5.499      2 Template:Template_style\n 11.79%    5.113      1 Template:PageSeo\n 11.64%    5.051      2 Template:H